  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Desktop HUD scales based on the pixel height of the window. This feels unnatural that the HUD would scale up based on height, let alone scale at all with window size. The HUD is unreadable at a smaller window size and very large on tall monitors.\n\nThis requests for options for adjusting the scale of the UI and the scaling behavior. I would prefer if the UI was pixel consistent so on larger resolutions it appears smaller (using the same pixel space). A general slider for the HUD scale would also be appreciated.",
